## The 2026 Swedish Cup

The Swedish Cup featured strong international contenders near the top of the results during the Swedish Championships weekend. However, the Cup standings were structured so that Swedish participants who competed consistently throughout the season (rather than just at a single championship weekend) were rewarded in the final classification.

The overall champions of the 2026 Swedish Cup:

- **M21:** Rasmus Nordgren, OK Kåre
- **W21:** Gabriella Gustafsson, IKHP Huskvarna
- **M17-20:** Joel Holmgård, Kils OK
- **W17-20:** Signe Feil, Sundsvalls OK

## Looking Ahead to 2027

We now close the books on 2026 and look forward to next season. Action gets underway as early as April with the MTBO Camp in Skåne (14–18 April), featuring training sessions, competitions, and the first two rounds of the Swedish Cup. Following that, highlights include Karlskrona in May, O-Ringen in Stockholm in July, alongside Sätervurpan and Traneträffen in August. There is plenty of exciting riding to look forward to next year!
